OL,3,CSomething old, something new? Why a
OL,4,CChester bride got wed in a #2 dress
OL,6,FGranada Reports correspondent Ann
OL,7,FO'Connor joined the happy couple on
OL,8,Ftheir big day
OL,10,FIt was a first class wedding in second
OL,11,Fhand clothes.
OL,13,FWhen musicians Gina and Jacob Dodds
OL,14,Fasked their guests to save the date
OL,15,Fthey also asked them to save the
OL,16,Fplanet, donate to charity and
OL,17,Fcelebrate their love by wearing pre-
OL,18,Floved charity shop clothes.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
