OL,3,CSomething old, something new? Why a
OL,4,CChester bride got wed in a #2 dress
OL,6,FSo as they tied the knot at the city's
OL,7,FStoryhouse arts venue, the bride FELT
OL,8,Fa million dollars but had spent a LOT
OL,9,Fless on her dress.
OL,11,F"My dress cost #2 in a charity shop,"
OL,12,Fsays Gina, looking down at the
OL,13,Fshimmering white strapless gown.
OL,15,F"I feel amazing in it, and it doesn't
OL,16,Fmatter what anyone else thinks, I feel
OL,17,Fincredible in it and I love it," she
OL,18,Fsays.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
