OL,3,CSomething old, something new? Why a
OL,4,CChester bride got wed in a #2 dress
OL,6,FShe and her new husband regularly shop
OL,7,Fin the city's charity shops and Gina
OL,8,Fstruck lucky with the help of Alex Cox
OL,9,Fat the Hope House Ty Gobaith branch in
OL,10,FChester.
OL,12,FMoney raised from sales there goes to
OL,13,Fhospice care for hundreds of children
OL,14,Fand their families across Cheshire,
OL,15,FShropshire and North Wales.
OL,17,FAlex is urging everyone to come to
OL,18,Fcharity shops, to help fund the vital
OL,19,Fwork they support.
OL,26,@qD@Ts|
