OL,3,CSomething old, something new? Why a
OL,4,CChester bride got wed in a #2 dress
OL,6,F"You might not find exactly what
OL,7,Fyou're looking for but if you try it
OL,8,Fon, style it up. It's always worth
OL,9,Fchecking out a charity shop."
OL,11,FThere was, of course, something new
OL,12,Fhere, the memories of a great day in
OL,13,Fthe knowledge they'd all helped needy
OL,14,Fcauses.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/4
